\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Strong Son of God, immortal Love,
\par Whom we, that have not seen Thy face,
\par By faith, and faith alone, embrace,
\par Believing where we cannot prove;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou wilt not leave us in the dust:
\par Thou madest man, he knows not why:
\par He thinks he was not made to die;
\par And Thou hast made him: Thou art just.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou seemest human and divine,
\par The highest, holiest manhood, Thou:
\par Our wills are ours, we know not how:
\par Our wills are ours, to make them Thine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Our little systems have their day:
\par They have their day and cease to be:
\par They are but broken lights of Thee,
\par And Thou, O Lord, art more than they.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

